#: src/components/atoms/EventTag.re.mjs:54
msgid ""
"This event is private. Please do not share this event without permission "
"from the organizer."
msgstr "このイベントは非公開です。主催者の許可なく共有しないでください。"

#: src/components/organisms/EventStickyFooter.re.mjs:165
msgid ""
"This is a deposit hold only — payment is due to the organizer at the event. "
"The hold will be released after the event."
msgstr ""
"これはデポジットの仮押さえのみです — 支払いはイベント当日に主催者へ行ってくだ"
"さい。仮押さえはイベント終了後に解除されます。"

#: src/components/organisms/StripePaymentEmbed.tsx:98
msgid ""
"This is a deposit hold only. You still need to pay the organizer in full at "
"the event. The hold will be released after the event."
msgstr ""
"これはデポジットの仮押さえのみです。イベント当日に主催者へ全額をお支払いくだ"
"さい。仮押さえはイベント終了後に解除されます。"

#: src/components/organisms/EventLocationAvailability.re.mjs:479
msgid ""
"This moves the event to another venue and reschedules everyone who already "
"RSVP'd. Tap again to confirm."
msgstr ""
"イベントが別の会場に移動され、すでにRSVP済みの全員のスケジュールが変更されま"
"す。もう一度タップして確認してください。"

#: src/components/organisms/EventLocationAvailability.re.mjs:437
